  "body": "Tick Control is a Random Tick Controller Plugin For Minecraft<br>\nCommand Help:<br>\n/tc reload - Reloads the plugin configuration.<br>\n/tc <on|off> - Enable/Disable main plugin functionality.<br>\n/tc lang <zh_cn|en> - Sets the plugin language.<br>\n/tc set <world|global> <option> <0-100%|off><br>\n/tc set <world|global> cropgrowth <all|master|crop_name> <0-100%|off> - Configure crop growth rates<br>\nAvailable options (case-insensitive): cactusgrowth, cauldroninteract, copperoxidation, cropgrowth, dripstonegrowth, farmlandhydration, fireburnout,\n firespread, grassmyceliumspread, iceform, icemelt, leavesdecay, mossspread, nyliumfungigrowth, redstoneoreglow, seapicklegrowth, sporeblossomspread, sugarcanebambo\nogrowth, turtleegghatch, twistingvinegrowth, vinegrowth, weepingvinegrowth",
